# The repository root ignores `shots/` and `dist/`, which is right for the
# engine — those are screenshots and build output, and both regenerate. Here
# they are neither. This endpoint has no seed input, so a take cannot be
# reproduced: delete the mp4 and that performance is gone for good, and the
# most you can do is roll again and hope. The takes are therefore source, and
# they are kept.
!shots/
!dist/

# The one genuine cache: local paths mapped to fal CDN URLs, which expire.
# Provenance lives in the sidecars next to each take.
refs/uploads.json
